#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows a tractor that has a centrally pivoted front suspension. The springs and dampers have been applied extremely close to each other so that no roll stiffness is contributed by either.
#
#The rear axle, while it does have a suspension, is substantially stiffer in roll than the front axle.  This will provide a reasonable simulation of the way a tractor drives, but it is not perfect.
#
#This example is here to show you that other vehicle types are possible with CarSim by using a little creativity.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

